<title>FINLAND: Nokia wins FIM 150 mln Chinese order.</title>
<headline>Nokia wins FIM 150 mln Chinese order.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish telecommunications group Nokia Oy said on Thursday it had won an order from Jiangxi PTA to expand its GSM network.</p>
<p>&quot;The value of the contract is approximately 150 million markka,&quot; Nokia said in a statement.</p>
</text>
